# A life total set to a number is gained or lost to get there (CR 119.5), so Boon Reflection doubles the gain of a total
# set higher (its 2020-08-07 ruling: from 3, "becomes 10" ends at 17). Bot2 Bolts Bot1 to 17; Bot1's Blessed Wind
# ("Target player's life total becomes 20") then gains Bot1 3 life, doubled to 6: 23, not 20.

